<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Qassim Cement 1996 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>Saudi Qassim Cement 1996 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	  152.4     vs    160.3</p>
<p> Operating income	144.8     vs    147.2</p>
<p> Operating cost	    7.3     vs	6.7</p>
<p> Other income	     14.9     vs     19.8</p>
<p> Shareholders' fund    793.6     vs    781.8</p>
<p> Assets		    909.9     vs    919.8</p>
<p>Full Name: Qassim Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The company, one of eight cement firms operating in Saudi Arabia, is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
